  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the oil in a large pot over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "3. Add the curry paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "4. Add the potatoes, coconut milk, fish sauce, and sugar. Stir to combine.",
    "5. Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 20-25 minutes, or until the potatoes are tender.",
    "6. Stir in the Thai basil and serve hot."
